(1) $\displaystyle P\{X>2 Y\}\\
=\iint\limits_{x>2 y} f(x, y) \mathrm{d} x \mathrm{d} y\\
=\int_0^1 \mathrm{d} x \int_0^{\frac{x}{2}}(2-x-y) \mathrm{d} y\\
=\frac{7}{24}$

(2) $\displaystyle F_Z(z)=P\{Z \leqslant z\}=P\{X+Y \leqslant z\}=\iint\limits_{x+y \leqslant z} f(x, y) \mathrm{d} x \mathrm{d} y$,

当 $z<0$ 时, $F_Z(z)=0$;

当 $0 \leqslant z<1$ 时, $\displaystyle F_z(z)=\int_0^z \mathrm{d} x \int_0^{z-x}(2-x-y) \mathrm{d} y=z^2-\frac{1}{3} z^3$;

当 $1 \leqslant z<2$ 时, $\displaystyle F_Z(z)=1-\int_{z-1}^1 \mathrm{d} x \int_{z-x}^1(2-x-y) \mathrm{d} y=1-\frac{1}{3}(2-z)^3$;

当 $z \geqslant 2$ 时, $F_Z(z)=1$,

于是 $f_Z(z)= \begin{cases}2 z-z^2, & 0<z<1 \\ z^2-4 z+4, & 1 \leqslant z<2 \\ 0, & \text { 其他 }\end{cases}$

